---
// ai-platform.md: how the product reaches the models, through an AI service in its own account,
// and the check every change to it passes.
---

<div>
  <div class="label">How AI reaches the product</div>
  <div class="row">
    <div class="c-pop box product">
      <div class="k">product</div>
      <div class="t">features that call AI</div>
      <div class="s">in the core platform</div>
    </div>
    <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</div>
    <div class="c-pop account">
      <div class="account-k">isolated AWS account</div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="c-pop box agent">
          <div class="k">AI agent service</div>
          <div class="t">Mastra agents &amp; workflows</div>
          <div class="s">TypeScript, like the rest of the platform</div>
        </div>
        <div class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">⇄</div>
        <div class="c-pop box models">
          <div class="k">models</div>
          <div class="t">Amazon Bedrock</div>
          <div class="s">inside the same cloud as everything else</div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
  <ol class="c-pop change" aria-label="Every change to the AI service">
    <li class="lead">every change:</li>
    <li><span class="chip">PR to the AI service</span></li>
    <li><span class="chip" data-tone="acc">eval suite in CI</span></li>
    <li><span class="chip" data-tone="ok">ships only if it passes</span></li>
  </ol>
</div>

<style>
  .label {
    margin-bottom: 12px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .row {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 10px 12px;
  }
  .box {
    min-width: 0;
    border: 1px solid var(--line3);
    border-radius: 10px;
    padding: 14px 16px;
  }
  .product {
    flex: 0 1 170px;
    animation-delay: 0.1s;
  }
  .account {
    flex: 1 1 520px;
    border: 1px dashed var(--acc);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 12px;
    animation-delay: 0.3s;
  }
  .account-k {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--acc);
  }
  .agent {
    flex: 1 1 220px;
    border-color: var(--acc);
    background: var(--acc-bg);
    animation-delay: 0.5s;
  }
  .models {
    flex: 1 1 180px;
    animation-delay: 0.7s;
  }
  .k {
    font-size: 12px;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .agent .k {
    color: var(--acc);
  }
  .t {
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--head);
  }
  .s {
    margin-top: 4px;
    font-size: 13px;
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  .agent .s {
    color: var(--text3);
  }
  .arrow {
    align-self: center;
    font-size: 18px;
    color: var(--acc);
  }
  :root[dir='rtl'] .arrow {
    scale: -1 1;
  }
  .change {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    margin: 14px 0 0;
    padding: 0;
    list-style: none;
    font-size: 14px;
    animation-delay: 0.9s;
  }
  .change li {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  .chip {
    border: 1px solid var(--line3);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 10px;
  }
  .change li:nth-child(n + 3)::before {
    content: '→' / '';
    color: var(--acc);
  }
  .lead {
    color: var(--mute);
  }
  [data-tone] {
    color: var(--head);
  }
  .chip[data-tone='acc'] {
    border-color: var(--acc);
  }
  .chip[data-tone='ok'] {
    border-color: var(--ok);
  }
</style>
